description:
Shaghaf Vanilla Toffee by Swiss Arabian is an indulgent fragrance that blends warmth and sweetness. Opening with buttery toffee and aromatic Arabic coffee, it transitions into a heart of walnut pastry and date milk, accented by vanilla and cardamom. The base is a rich mix of Madagascar vanilla caviar, brown sugar, tonka bean, and benzoin, creating a long-lasting, seductive scent. Perfect for those who love a luxurious, comforting fragrance with an exotic twist.

Shaghaf Vanilla Toffee was launched in 2024. 

Top notes are Toffee and Coffee; 

middle notes are Vanilla, Walnut, Dates, Cardamom and Milk; 

base notes are Brown sugar, Madagascar Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Woody Notes, Benzoin, Vanilla Caviar and Musk.

This floral perfume is inspired by discoveries and connections. Created for the open-minded, curious, and authentic woman who is ready to broaden her horizons, the elegant fragrance sources three key ingredients from around the world: the orange blossom extracted from hand-picked bitter orange fruits in Egypt; the Indian tuberose flower sourced and handpicked near Mysore, India; and vanilla sourced through a responsible program designed to support local communities in Madagascar.

Inspired by My Way by Giorgio Armani.

Notes Details:

TOP NOTES: Bergamot, Orange Blossom;

MIDDLE NOTES: Tuberose, Jasmine;

BASE NOTES: Cedarwood, Vanilla, White Musks.
